            "detailed_description": "Cast down from power by a mysterious warlord centuries ago, Kain reawakens in a world he barely recognises. His armies slain, his vampire brethren nearly extinct, Kain is one of the last of his kind. With an agenda of vengeance, Kain shall unleash a wicked wrath to uncover the plot that threatens the land he seeks to conquer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n• Execute fierce attacks and brutal combos with battle-axes, swords and other heavy metal weaponry.<br />\r\n• When weapon edges dull on bone and steel, turn to your Dark Gifts such as berserk and stealth to exact your lethal will.<br />\r\n• In pursuit of power or just for the thrill of the kill, Kain’s lust for blood is inspiring.<br />\r\n• Lead Kain through highly detailed environments of gothic nightmare; host to thieves, knights and demons of all sorts.",
